## Environments

| Command | Compose files | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `make dev` | `docker-compose.dev.yml` | Development: source mounted, reload on change. |
| `make prod-local` | `docker-compose.prod.yml` + `docker-compose.prod-local.yml` | The production stack on this machine, as a rehearsal: production images and settings (`ENVIRONMENT=production`), random secrets generated in `.env.prod-local`, plain HTTP on localhost. |
| `make prod` | `docker-compose.prod.yml` | Production behind Traefik with TLS. Requires `backend/.env` with real secrets, `DOMAIN` and `ACME_EMAIL`. |

Each has `-down` and `-logs` siblings (`make prod-local-down`). For Kubernetes, see
`kubernetes/`.

