## Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
bun install
bun dev          # http://localhost:{{ frontend_port }}
bun run lint
bun run build
```

The frontend is a static React build (Vite) served by nginx. It calls the API directly at
`VITE_API_URL`, fixed at build time, with the generated client in `src/client/`; regenerate
it with `make client` after a backend change. Text is translated with i18next: English in the
code, Italian in `src/locales/it.json` (`bun run i18n:check`).
{%- endif %}

